<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <%= render 'layouts/header_mail' %>
  <body>
    <h4>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</h4>
    <% if @notifications > 0  %>
        You have <%= pluralize(@notifications, "new notification") %>. <%= link_to "Log in", @url_login, class:'mail-btn'  %> to see your unread <%= "notification".pluralize(@notifications) %>!
    <% end %>
    <p>
      smartXchange is proud to have entered its tenth month since launching!
      Over the past month we have improved our matching algorithm, re-designed our landing page, improved the display of boards notifications, performed more security checks from third party websites, improved translate-on-demand so the from-language matches your nationality, and debugged comments on the boards pages.
      Most importantly, we have added an email for notifying users of unread materials, so if a tutor has uploaded material since you last logged into your account, you will now be notified via email!
      Lastly, we have added a third party service for handling our emails and we have added a link to our instagram account in the mail footer, which now has over 200 followers!
    </p>
  </body>
  <%= render 'layouts/footer_mail' %>
</html>
